<title>UK: Yates Brothers Wine H1 pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Yates Brothers Wine H1 pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.1		    vs  5.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.44		   vs  1.2</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.3		    vs  3.2</p>
<p> Turnover		  34.4		    vs 29.2</p>
<p> Operating profit	 4.4		    vs 3.3</p>
<p> Exceptional gain	 0.2		    vs nil</p>
<p> Interest		   0.4		    vs 0.1</p>
<p> Tax			  1.0		    vs 0.9</p>
<p> Net taxed		  3.2		    vs 2.3</p>
<p> Pay date		   Feb 21, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 24  Ex-div date		Dec 16</p>
<p>NOTE: Current half-year results include an exceptional gain of 229,000 stg on the disposal of properties. Yates Brothers Wine Lodges Plc is a retailer of wines, spirits and beers.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
